{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "05c7132c-dddf-85e6-9111-959abbff05a8",
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T17:14:27-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ricardo Morales",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T17:10:19-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T17:10:23-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hello. Is this the, um, the line for after hours? I know City Hall is closed, it's after five, but the recording said to call this number for storm stuff."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T17:10:36-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, this is the one. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T17:10:40-04:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so it's the storm drain at the corner by my house. I'm at 299 Pelham Street, up on the Hill. After that rain Friday into Saturday, three days ago now, the water just sits there. It's still pooled right across the crosswalk by the school bus stop."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T17:10:59-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Still there today, Tuesday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T17:11:02-04:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Still there. Well, less, but it's a big puddle, and the kids at the bus stop, they're stepping out into the road to get around it. Right into the lane. I watched it this morning and I thought, somebody's going to get clipped by a car."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T17:11:21-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's not good. Is the drain itself covered up, do you know? Leaves, debris?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T17:11:28-04:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's all packed, and the sidewalk is a sheet of mud and grit. Everything washed down and just stayed. You can't walk on it without sliding. Sorry, what was I saying, I had a whole thing. Oh, the mud, yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T17:11:45-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's okay. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T17:11:48-04:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[laughs] Thank you. So what I want to know is, when did they last come by? Because nobody has been out here, not that I've seen. I'm home most of the day and I would see a truck. This happens every time it rains hard and I feel like nobody ever cleans it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T17:12:09-04:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have the cleaning schedule in front of me for that street, and I can't see from this screen when a crew last did that drain. What I can do is put in a request for today, flagged as a hazard because of the kids and the crosswalk, and the day crew will see it first thing tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T17:12:32-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, but will somebody actually come? Because I feel like I've said this before and it just goes in a pile."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T17:12:41-04:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'll mark it as a safety issue at a school stop, and I'll note that the drain is clogged and the sidewalk is covered in silt. That gets looked at ahead of the routine ones. I can't promise you an hour, but it goes on tomorrow's list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T17:13:01-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. That's something. I just, you know, it keeps happening and it's the same spot every time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T17:13:08-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Let me get your info. Name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T17:13:12-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ricardo Morales. M-O-R-A-L-E-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T17:13:14-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And the best number to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T17:13:18-04:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0168. It's my cell, so if it drops, call right back. The reception in the kitchen is terrible. I'm sitting at the table right now writing out my holiday card list by hand, and I keep walking around to find a bar. Don't ask why I'm doing it in March. [laughs]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T17:13:38-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[laughs] Getting ahead for next year. Okay, so 299 Pelham, storm drain at the corner clogged, water over the crosswalk by the bus stop, kids stepping into the road, mud on the sidewalk. Did I get it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T17:13:53-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it, yes. Exactly. Oh, and tell them it's the corner, not mid-block. Last time I think they went to the wrong spot, maybe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T17:14:03-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The corner, not mid-block. Added. If you see it get worse, or a car comes close to someone, call back right away and say it's urgent."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T17:14:14-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Okay, thank you, Denise. I appreciate you taking it this late."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T17:14:20-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, Mr. Morales. You have a good night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T17:14:24-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
